-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. COMPATIBILITY NOTE — READ THIS BEFORE REDISTRIBUTING
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The upstream Atari core's non-commercial condition and the GPL of the NESTang
IO subsystem are not strictly compatible: the GPL forbids imposing further
restrictions on GPL-covered code, and "non-commercial" is such a restriction.
This tension is inherited from the upstream projects that this port combines —
it is not created by the port itself, and it exists identically in
Atari800_MiSTer-derived cores built on nand2mario's Tang IO subsystem.

This project's response is to be maximally transparent rather than to paper
over it:

  * every upstream copyright and licence notice is preserved in place;
  * complete corresponding source for every component is in this public
    repository, satisfying the GPL's source-availability obligations;
  * the whole is distributed free of charge, for non-commercial use;
  * no additional restriction is asserted over any individual third-party file
    beyond what its own licence already says;
  * the port's own original files are dual licensed CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 OR
    GPL-3.0-or-later, so that they add no new incompatibility of their own —
    anyone who needs GPL-compatible terms for this port's work can simply take
    the GPL option (LICENSE-PORT).

If you are a copyright holder of any component here and want your code handled
differently, please open an issue — it will be honoured.


-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. FOR CONTRIBUTORS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Contributions to files original to this port are accepted under BOTH options of
LICENSE-PORT (CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 OR GPL-3.0-or-later); by submitting a change you
licence it under both. Contributions to third-party files stay under that file's own
licence. Keep every existing header notice intact, and add the upstream licence
to the table above whenever a new third-party file enters the tree.
